// drydock nested/stealth Zellij config (REQ-16 / REQ-17, design D-22).
// Loaded when DRYDOCK_NESTED_ZELLIJ=1 and DRYDOCK_FORCE_INNER_ZELLIJ_FULL is unset.
//
// default_mode "locked": inner Zellij captures no keystrokes; the user's
// host Zellij session remains in control. The inner Zellij is effectively
// invisible as a multiplexer.
// simplified_ui true: disables status bar / tabs / pane-frames chrome — the inner
// Zellij is visually invisible in the user's host terminal (satisfies REQ-16's
// "hide the status bar" acceptance criterion).

default_mode "locked"
pane_frames false
simplified_ui true
